---
/** Telecom Hub: Four Questions Every MSP Must Answer Before Launching Mobile Services */
---

<section class="sec">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head rv">
      <h2 class="h2"><em class="s">Four Questions</em> Every MSP Must Answer Before Launching Mobile Services</h2>
      <p class="lede">Connectivity solutions designed for teams who work beyond the desk, keeping staff productive, compliant, and always connected.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="q4">
      <div class="q-list rv" id="qlist">
        <div class="q-item on" data-q="1"><span class="prob-no">01</span><h3>How do you access operators globally without months of negotiations and contracts?</h3></div>
        <div class="q-item" data-q="2"><span class="prob-no">02</span><h3>How do you eliminate multi-million dollar carrier contract negotiations?</h3></div>
        <div class="q-item" data-q="3"><span class="prob-no">03</span><h3>How do you manage billing, provisioning, and compliance across multiple carriers?</h3></div>
        <div class="q-item" data-q="4"><span class="prob-no">04</span><h3>How do you ensure failover and optimize routing when carriers underperform?</h3></div>
      </div>
      <div class="rv">
        <svg class="tower" viewBox="0 0 470 560" role="img" aria-label="TelecomHub answers: 01 Global operator access, in hours. 02 No carrier contract negotiations. 03 Billing, provisioning and compliance. 04 Failover and smart routing.">
          <!-- signal -->
          <path class="wave w2" d="M205 40 a40 40 0 0 1 60 0"/>
          <path class="wave" d="M217 54 a22 22 0 0 1 36 0"/>
          <circle cx="235" cy="70" r="7" fill="#ff4904"/>
          <line class="tw" x1="235" y1="77" x2="235" y2="110"/>
          <!-- antennas -->
          <rect class="tw2" x="196" y="128" width="8" height="26" rx="3"/><rect class="tw2" x="266" y="128" width="8" height="26" rx="3"/>
          <line class="tw2" x1="204" y1="141" x2="266" y2="141"/>
          <!-- mast -->
          <path class="tw" d="M222 110 L248 110 L292 520 L178 520 Z"/>
          <g class="tw2">
            <line x1="216" y1="170" x2="254" y2="170"/><line x1="208" y1="240" x2="262" y2="240"/><line x1="200" y1="310" x2="270" y2="310"/><line x1="192" y1="380" x2="278" y2="380"/><line x1="185" y1="450" x2="285" y2="450"/>
            <path d="M216 170 L262 240 M254 170 L208 240 M208 240 L270 310 M262 240 L200 310 M200 310 L278 380 M270 310 L192 380 M192 380 L285 450 M278 380 L185 450 M185 450 L292 520 M285 450 L178 520"/>
          </g>
          <line x1="100" y1="520" x2="370" y2="520" stroke="#ddd6cc" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          <!-- leaders -->
          <path class="lead" d="M170 176 L226 196"/><circle cx="226" cy="196" r="4" fill="#ff4904"/>
          <path class="lead" d="M300 256 L252 272"/><circle cx="252" cy="272" r="4" fill="#ff4904"/>
          <path class="lead" d="M170 356 L208 372"/><circle cx="208" cy="372" r="4" fill="#ff4904"/>
          <path class="lead" d="M300 436 L272 448"/><circle cx="272" cy="448" r="4" fill="#ff4904"/>
          <!-- tags -->
          <g class="tag on" data-q="1"><rect x="0" y="136" width="170" height="80" rx="12"/><text class="n" x="16" y="160">01</text><text class="t" x="16" y="184">Global operator</text><text class="t" x="16" y="203">access, in hours</text></g>
          <g class="tag" data-q="2"><rect x="300" y="216" width="170" height="80" rx="12"/><text class="n" x="316" y="240">02</text><text class="t" x="316" y="264">No carrier contract</text><text class="t" x="316" y="283">negotiations</text></g>
          <g class="tag" data-q="3"><rect x="0" y="316" width="170" height="80" rx="12"/><text class="n" x="16" y="340">03</text><text class="t" x="16" y="364">Billing, provisioning</text><text class="t" x="16" y="383">&amp; compliance</text></g>
          <g class="tag" data-q="4"><rect x="300" y="396" width="170" height="80" rx="12"/><text class="n" x="316" y="420">04</text><text class="t" x="316" y="444">Failover &amp; smart</text><text class="t" x="316" y="463">routing</text></g>
        </svg>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
